[2] with correlated subquery: still sscan sq_big (regression = iscan on i_sq_big_flag)     

===================================================
id    
12345     

Query plan:
iscan
    class: c node[?]
    index: i_sq_child_big term[?] (covers)
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
(select count(*) from sq_child c where c.big_id=b.id)
Query plan:
sscan
    class: b node[?]
    sargs: term[?] AND term[?] AND term[?]
    subqs: ?
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select b.id from sq_big b where (select count(*) from sq_child c where c.big_id=b.id)>? and b.txt= ?:?  and b.flag= ?:? 
